{"title":"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The ten-letter code <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/a/81ac8a26268b43ab7fcb16b1b30387b35587d350.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{BEST OF LUCK}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"126\" height=\"12\" /> represents the ten digits <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/4/53458ebc12bfd4c66c5cad57012a1200803297e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0-9$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, in order. What 4-digit number is represented by the code word <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/f/bdfe5d42c24cb0fe7e2885c3d932cebf2bc8b1ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{CLUE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/f/6dfea6d5946ab9d2e6c69ffe44ea38ec5bed7fe6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 8671 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 8672 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 9781 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 9782 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 9872$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"484\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can derive that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/9/a29bb79a3ae675aa6299000e7be0fb0f4dd8cfec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/4/8b4bf0c4ca556bbeb07820be821196c918f8143b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L=6$\" width=\"45\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/f/68fbc322d4d70a4216eab7e4f4c9aa2a69b153e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U=7$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/f/53f0172b197ab4a1d692269c3fc5b45499230322.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/5/c857802646ef2f1b6f8eb5842c3fd45e1d0ce65c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 8671}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"83\" height=\"28\" />\n~edited by OwenTang\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can easily see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/9/a29bb79a3ae675aa6299000e7be0fb0f4dd8cfec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />, which makes only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/5/565ab5e3715db52b9176b04dd9991b71f4e93a86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/8/0c87def975f94684a4320a834c7fd6bf719b92c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8761$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/3/313048c3149436615f6cd06b7f1bec83420d6a37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(B)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/f/58ffb3126140a5cb5f503607c54ad78b4e2c7bc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8762$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> possible. Since the only difference between answer choices <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is the last digit and that the last digit in the code word \"CLUE\" is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, we can just find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/f/53f0172b197ab4a1d692269c3fc5b45499230322.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" /> and that the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/5/c857802646ef2f1b6f8eb5842c3fd45e1d0ce65c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ 8671}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"83\" height=\"28\" />. ~solution by SuperVince1\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8\" title=\"2008 AMC 8\">2008 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2008\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Pr